  - [ ] Parse contents of style rules allowing nested rules
  - [ ] Required for CSS Nesting support
- [ ] Normalize input token stream (§5.3)
  - [ ] Handle string → token list conversion
  - [ ] Handle component value list → token list

#### 7.7.2 Parser Algorithms (§5.4)
- [ ] Consume_Style_Block_Contents (§5.4.4)
